==========================================================================
PROVENANCE & ATTRIBUTION
==========================================================================

This project's layout scaffolding, CSS foundation and select UI patterns
are historically derived from "Simple Light" by Cruip (https://cruip.com),
used as the starting template for this codebase. Substantial custom
architecture has been built on top of that foundation, including:

  - The multi-brand project engine (projects/<slug>/ configuration,
    navigation/footer/legal inversion of control, theme token layer);
  - The Zod-validated bilingual content layer (pricing, FAQ, manifesto);
  - The pluggable inbound Lead API and statutory compliance pages;
  - All brand-specific copy, components and commercial logic.

Per the terms of the upstream license heritage, the combined work is
distributed under GNU GPL-3.0. Cruip retains copyright on the original
"Simple Light" components; UnderUndre claims copyright on the custom
architecture and content layered above them.

